' RoomieSync - Project Gantt Chart
' Chapter 3 - Planning and Scheduling
' Build:  plantuml -tsvg gantt_chart.puml
'
' Activities A1-A13 mirror the PERT chart (pert_chart.puml): the same tasks
' with the same estimated durations in working days. Tasks chain sequentially
' through the backend (A1, A2, A3) while auth (A4) runs in parallel; the six
' module tasks (A5-A10) run in parallel off the completed backend API, then
' converge on frontend integration (A11), testing (A12) and deployment (A13).
' Weekends are closed (5-day working week).
'
' COLOUR POLICY - deliberate, Gantt-only exception to the project-wide
' "skinparam monochrome true" rule. Colours sit on a lightness ladder so the
' phases stay tellable apart when the black book is printed in black and white:
'   Phase 1  Planning & Requirements   pale green  #C9E4C5
'   Phase 2  Database & Backend        amber       #E0AE45
'   Phase 3  Core Modules              mid blue    #4E93BE
'   Phase 4  Frontend Integration      indigo      #5B4B85
'   Phase 5  Testing & Deployment      deep red    #8E1B12

@startgantt

skinparam defaultFontName "Liberation Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontStyle bold
skinparam titleFontSize 24
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam taskBorderThickness 2

title RoomieSync - Project Development Schedule (Gantt Chart)

Project starts 2026-02-02
saturday are closed
sunday are closed

-- Phase 1: Planning & Requirements --

[Project Planning & Requirements] as [A1] lasts 2 days
[Project Planning & Requirements] is colored in #C9E4C5/#3F6B39

